1
00:00:04,250 --> 00:00:07,250
We intercepted a transmission
on Balnab.

2
00:00:07,375 --> 00:00:10,416
- Bunch of talk of a secret network.

3
00:00:12,666 --> 00:00:14,583
I need to find out where they are, Leia.

4
00:00:18,000 --> 00:00:20,750
Too many people are looking for you.
You put us all in danger.

5
00:00:20,833 --> 00:00:21,916
I need your help.

6
00:00:22,000 --> 00:00:24,958
She's ten years old.
I won't leave her there.

7
00:00:25,041 --> 00:00:27,083
Let go! Let me out!

8
00:00:27,625 --> 00:00:28,791
It's suicide.

9
00:00:28,875 --> 00:00:29,916
I'll go with him.

10
00:00:30,000 --> 00:00:31,416
I have officer clearance.

11
00:00:31,500 --> 00:00:33,833
I can get you inside,
and I can get you access.

12
00:00:34,500 --> 00:00:35,500
Here we go.

13
00:00:38,750 --> 00:00:40,083
A traitor!

14
00:00:40,916 --> 00:00:44,833
A child and an old man.
Was it worth it?

15
00:00:47,083 --> 00:00:49,083
Betraying everything you are.

16
00:00:49,166 --> 00:00:50,750
This was never who I was.

17
00:00:54,666 --> 00:00:56,250
Come on. Get in.

18
00:00:58,708 --> 00:01:00,083
All right, I'm right behind you.

19
00:01:02,041 --> 00:01:03,041
Wade!

20
00:01:03,916 --> 00:01:07,416
You're certain the tracker is with him?

21
00:01:08,041 --> 00:01:09,291
Yes, my Lord.

22
00:01:11,041 --> 00:01:12,125
Where he goes,

23
00:01:13,333 --> 00:01:14,500
it will follow.

24
00:02:11,333 --> 00:02:12,500
Ah, there you are.

25
00:02:15,041 --> 00:02:17,958
Was beginning to think
you weren't coming, Master.

26
00:02:18,708 --> 00:02:19,708
Good.

27
00:02:19,791 --> 00:02:22,208
Then, maybe I stand
more of a chance this time.

28
00:02:24,625 --> 00:02:25,875
Are you ready?

29
00:02:29,083 --> 00:02:30,125
Are you?

30
00:02:32,458 --> 00:02:33,791
Then, let's begin.

31
00:02:48,875 --> 00:02:49,916
My Lord.

32
00:02:52,666 --> 00:02:54,583
The Third Sister is here.

33
00:03:01,625 --> 00:03:06,208
It is my great honor
to be invited aboard, Lord Vader.

34
00:03:06,291 --> 00:03:08,958
I am not interested in civilities.

35
00:03:09,041 --> 00:03:11,125
Where is he?

36
00:03:11,208 --> 00:03:12,625
The tracker worked.

37
00:03:12,708 --> 00:03:14,708
He's arriving on Jabiim as we speak.

38
00:03:16,666 --> 00:03:18,291
You have done well.

39
00:03:21,791 --> 00:03:23,250
Kneel...

40
00:03:29,333 --> 00:03:31,791
Grand Inquisitor.

41
00:03:40,000 --> 00:03:41,750
Set a course, Captain.

42
00:03:42,458 --> 00:03:45,000
We leave for Jabiim at once.

43
00:04:19,083 --> 00:04:20,083
We got her.

44
00:04:32,625 --> 00:04:33,666
Haja?

45
00:04:34,291 --> 00:04:35,708
What are you doing here?

46
00:04:35,791 --> 00:04:37,458
I had nowhere else to go.

47
00:04:37,541 --> 00:04:41,208
Right after I saw you, I got into a fight
with that scary lady Inquisitor.

48
00:04:41,875 --> 00:04:43,375
Now, I'm wanted by the Empire.

49
00:04:44,708 --> 00:04:47,208
But now, I know what it feels like
being a real Jedi.

50
00:04:47,916 --> 00:04:49,416
It's not easy.

51
00:04:50,750 --> 00:04:52,958
This place is a good
business opportunity though.

52
00:04:54,666 --> 00:04:55,666
On you go.

53
00:04:57,083 --> 00:04:58,375
Roken,

54
00:04:58,458 --> 00:05:01,333
that transport,
I need to get her back to Alderaan.

55
00:05:01,416 --> 00:05:04,208
Once we get all these people out of here,
I'll do whatever you want.

56
00:05:04,291 --> 00:05:05,583
They've been waiting for months.

57
00:05:05,666 --> 00:05:08,541
We used an old trade route to get them out
but the window's closing.

58
00:05:08,625 --> 00:05:10,750
We held it to help you get the kid.

59
00:05:10,833 --> 00:05:12,333
We only have a few hours.

60
00:05:15,916 --> 00:05:18,916
It's going to be all right.
The Path will protect us.

61
00:05:20,833 --> 00:05:22,500
We'll do whatever we can to help.

62
00:05:24,666 --> 00:05:26,541
All right, all right, let's hurry it up.

63
00:05:26,625 --> 00:05:29,541
Get ready for dust-off.
Leave anything you don't need.

64
00:05:39,666 --> 00:05:41,458
My Lord, we're approaching Jabiim.

65
00:05:42,791 --> 00:05:45,083
Lock down the facility.

66
00:05:45,166 --> 00:05:48,041
If we seal them in now,
they can hold out for days.

67
00:05:48,125 --> 00:05:50,125
If we cannot break them...

68
00:05:51,041 --> 00:05:54,083
It is not them we need to break.

69
00:06:28,000 --> 00:06:32,041
"The light will fade,
but is never forgotten."

70
00:07:18,125 --> 00:07:20,291
- What's happening?
- The controls aren't responding.

71
00:07:20,375 --> 00:07:22,500
An Imperial Destroyer
just arrived in orbit above us.

72
00:07:22,583 --> 00:07:23,791
She must have tracked us.

73
00:07:23,875 --> 00:07:25,583
It's not her. It's Vader.

74
00:07:26,583 --> 00:07:28,000
He wants us to surrender.

75
00:07:28,500 --> 00:07:30,250
If we surrender, he'll kill us all.

76
00:07:30,333 --> 00:07:32,958
He'll attack next.
He hasn't the patience for a siege.

77
00:07:33,041 --> 00:07:34,250
How do you know?

78
00:07:43,916 --> 00:07:46,208
You grow too aggressive, Anakin.
Be mindful.

79
00:07:46,708 --> 00:07:49,250
A Jedi's goal is to defend life,
not take it.

80
00:07:52,125 --> 00:07:54,083
Mercy doesn't defeat an enemy, Master.

81
00:07:58,500 --> 00:08:00,291
Which is why you're gonna lose.

82
00:08:09,875 --> 00:08:11,666
Launch the attack.

83
00:08:21,416 --> 00:08:23,500
There, there. It'll be okay.

84
00:08:26,291 --> 00:08:27,291
Everyone.

85
00:08:29,083 --> 00:08:30,083
Everyone.

86
00:08:30,666 --> 00:08:33,041
I understand you're scared.

87
00:08:33,125 --> 00:08:34,875
The Empire will attack soon.

88
00:08:35,500 --> 00:08:37,000
They're stronger than us,

89
00:08:37,083 --> 00:08:38,958
better equipped, better trained.

90
00:08:39,041 --> 00:08:41,666
If we try and fight them,
we will not survive.

91
00:08:43,166 --> 00:08:44,875
But we do not need to fight them.

92
00:08:44,958 --> 00:08:48,000
We just need to hold them off long enough
to get you all out.

93
00:08:48,083 --> 00:08:51,000
Roken, how much time do you need
to override the doors?

94
00:08:51,083 --> 00:08:52,083
Three, four hours.

95
00:08:52,166 --> 00:08:53,416
You have one.

96
00:08:53,583 --> 00:08:55,166
And block every other remote access.

97
00:08:55,250 --> 00:08:59,291
Everyone else, we're gonna lock down
every other entrance in this facility.

98
00:08:59,375 --> 00:09:02,125
If we defend our position together,

99
00:09:03,666 --> 00:09:06,041
then by the time they get inside,
we'll be gone.

100
00:09:07,041 --> 00:09:08,125
You heard him.

101
00:09:09,458 --> 00:09:11,250
Let's move it, people! Let's go!

102
00:09:36,791 --> 00:09:37,791
Seal all the doors.

103
00:09:48,291 --> 00:09:50,833
Move. Move! Move! Move now!

104
00:09:50,916 --> 00:09:52,625
Steady fire! Steady fire!

105
00:09:52,708 --> 00:09:53,875
Go! Go! Go! Go! Go!

106
00:09:54,583 --> 00:09:56,083
Man positions!

107
00:09:56,500 --> 00:09:57,541
Attack!

108
00:10:01,583 --> 00:10:02,625
Lock it in.

109
00:10:04,125 --> 00:10:05,416
Full load, full power.

110
00:10:38,958 --> 00:10:40,000
Fire!

111
00:10:46,291 --> 00:10:47,291
Light 'em up!

112
00:10:51,541 --> 00:10:52,708
It's a heavy gun.

113
00:10:52,791 --> 00:10:54,708
They're trying to blast
through the outside door.

114
00:10:54,791 --> 00:10:57,000
Roken, we need the hangar roof open.

115
00:11:01,625 --> 00:11:03,625
Come on. Come on. Come on. Come on.

116
00:11:09,041 --> 00:11:10,166
That was underwhelming.

117
00:11:10,750 --> 00:11:11,833
I don't need your opinion.

118
00:11:11,916 --> 00:11:13,875
Did you try going in the vents
to see what's going on?

119
00:11:13,958 --> 00:11:16,250
I'm a little too big
to be crawling around in the vents.

120
00:11:16,333 --> 00:11:17,875
Would you like to try?

121
00:11:17,958 --> 00:11:19,416
I'm going to need a ladder.

122
00:11:20,791 --> 00:11:22,666
It's not playtime right now, Princess.

123
00:11:22,750 --> 00:11:23,791
Do as she asks.

124
00:11:25,250 --> 00:11:27,625
You trust me? I trust her.

125
00:11:27,708 --> 00:11:28,750
Get her the ladder.

126
00:11:32,916 --> 00:11:35,416
Get her a ladder. Quick.
Right away!

127
00:11:35,500 --> 00:11:36,500
Leia.

128
00:11:38,708 --> 00:11:39,708
Be careful.

129
00:11:42,458 --> 00:11:44,041
Haja, will you keep your eye on her?

130
00:11:44,125 --> 00:11:45,958
- I am not a babysitter, Ben.

131
00:11:47,458 --> 00:11:48,458
I have to go.

132
00:11:52,000 --> 00:11:53,833
Okay. Okay, okay.

133
00:12:13,000 --> 00:12:17,625
I know we said no communication,
but your silence worries me.

134
00:12:19,708 --> 00:12:22,125
If he's found you,
if he's learned of the children...

135
00:12:22,833 --> 00:12:25,916
If I don't hear from you soon,
I'll head to Tatooine.

136
00:12:26,625 --> 00:12:28,250
Owen will need help with the boy.

137
00:12:29,541 --> 00:12:32,208
I pray you're safe, Obi-Wan.

138
00:12:34,500 --> 00:12:35,541
Both of you.

139
00:12:45,625 --> 00:12:46,750
Is everything all right?

140
00:12:49,625 --> 00:12:50,750
It will be.

141
00:12:57,750 --> 00:13:00,583
You know, I was following orders on Garel.

142
00:13:01,208 --> 00:13:03,000
The Empire said it was a roundup.

143
00:13:03,083 --> 00:13:05,541
People not paying their way,
taxes for the cause.

144
00:13:06,958 --> 00:13:07,958
They lied.

145
00:13:10,625 --> 00:13:14,916
There were four families,
all Force-sensitive,

146
00:13:15,000 --> 00:13:16,041
and we,

147
00:13:16,791 --> 00:13:18,000
we gathered them up.

148
00:13:20,291 --> 00:13:24,208
I didn't know who they were. I didn't know
what the Inquisitors would do.

149
00:13:25,208 --> 00:13:28,000
Fourteen people died,
and six of them were children,

150
00:13:28,083 --> 00:13:30,166
and I couldn't do anything to help them.

151
00:13:35,291 --> 00:13:36,791
So now, I do this.

152
00:13:41,333 --> 00:13:43,250
One for every one I get through.

153
00:13:47,083 --> 00:13:48,083
You're right, Ben.

154
00:13:49,416 --> 00:13:51,250
Some things you can't forget.

155
00:13:53,750 --> 00:13:55,750
But you can fight to make them better.

156
00:14:01,208 --> 00:14:02,250
We're in trouble.

157
00:14:11,708 --> 00:14:13,333
Here. Got enough rounds?

158
00:14:13,416 --> 00:14:15,333
I don't know how long it's gonna hold.

159
00:14:15,416 --> 00:14:16,500
We got a plan B here?

160
00:14:16,583 --> 00:14:18,666
We're going to have to slow them down.

161
00:14:18,750 --> 00:14:20,500
Tell the Inquisitor I want to talk.

162
00:14:23,166 --> 00:14:25,458
She started this when she kidnapped Leia.

163
00:14:27,083 --> 00:14:28,666
I'll buy as much time as I can.

164
00:14:31,708 --> 00:14:33,666
He's requesting to negotiate.

165
00:15:14,000 --> 00:15:18,125
If this is you stalling for time,
it won't work.

166
00:15:18,708 --> 00:15:20,958
Lord Vader will have you at any cost.

167
00:15:23,125 --> 00:15:24,541
You mean, Anakin.

168
00:15:25,916 --> 00:15:27,916
You knew who Vader was.

169
00:15:29,291 --> 00:15:31,541
Back on Daiyu, how did you know that?

170
00:15:34,291 --> 00:15:36,000
Vader would have kept that hidden,

171
00:15:37,583 --> 00:15:40,000
and you're too young to have known him.

172
00:15:42,708 --> 00:15:43,750
Unless...

173
00:15:48,541 --> 00:15:49,791
Unless you were there.

174
00:15:50,458 --> 00:15:51,833
It doesn't matter where I was.

175
00:15:51,916 --> 00:15:55,250
The night of Order 66,
you were a youngling.

176
00:15:55,333 --> 00:15:57,416
That's how you knew. You saw him.

177
00:15:57,500 --> 00:15:58,541
Stop.

178
00:15:58,625 --> 00:16:00,958
- Anakin killed the others.
- That's enough.

179
00:16:01,041 --> 00:16:02,458
He killed the other younglings,

180
00:16:02,541 --> 00:16:04,125
- but somehow you su--
- Enough. Enough!

181
00:16:34,958 --> 00:16:36,791
We thought he was there to help us.

182
00:16:43,500 --> 00:16:45,375
I tried to help them, but I couldn't.

183
00:16:47,291 --> 00:16:48,583
I was too weak.

184
00:16:50,666 --> 00:16:51,708
When he left,

185
00:16:52,666 --> 00:16:53,833
I played dead.

186
00:16:55,750 --> 00:16:57,166
Hid with the bodies.

187
00:16:58,541 --> 00:17:00,208
Felt them go cold.

188
00:17:04,916 --> 00:17:07,375
They were the only family I knew,

189
00:17:09,375 --> 00:17:11,125
and he slaughtered them.

190
00:17:17,833 --> 00:17:19,666
You're not serving him, are you?

191
00:17:21,083 --> 00:17:22,583
You're hunting him.

192
00:17:23,833 --> 00:17:24,916
Let me help you.

193
00:17:25,000 --> 00:17:26,416
Why would I ever trust you?

194
00:17:26,500 --> 00:17:28,916
- Because we want the same thing.
- Do we, Obi-Wan?

195
00:17:30,291 --> 00:17:32,333
Do you really want Anakin dead?

196
00:17:37,208 --> 00:17:38,250
Where were you

197
00:17:39,666 --> 00:17:41,666
while he was killing my friends?

198
00:17:44,083 --> 00:17:45,458
He was your Padawan.

199
00:17:48,500 --> 00:17:51,041
Why didn't you stop him?
Why didn't you save us?

200
00:17:55,541 --> 00:17:58,041
I don't need your help.

201
00:18:00,666 --> 00:18:03,958
I don't need anyone.

202
00:18:04,625 --> 00:18:06,083
You won't stop him alone.

203
00:18:06,916 --> 00:18:11,125
You have no idea what I've done alone.

204
00:18:23,125 --> 00:18:24,916
Fall back to second position!

205
00:18:25,125 --> 00:18:26,750
Let's go!
Don't let them pass!

206
00:18:26,833 --> 00:18:28,375
All squads, forward!

207
00:18:29,041 --> 00:18:30,250
Into the breach!

208
00:18:30,333 --> 00:18:31,500
Fire!

209
00:18:32,041 --> 00:18:34,000
Over there! Over there!

210
00:18:36,000 --> 00:18:38,375
Hold your ground!
Don't let them through!

211
00:18:45,166 --> 00:18:47,458
Squad Eight, advance!

212
00:18:50,541 --> 00:18:52,166
Take cover!

213
00:18:52,250 --> 00:18:53,333
Flank left!

214
00:18:55,166 --> 00:18:57,250
Take them down!
Go! Go!

215
00:19:06,041 --> 00:19:07,083
Go!

216
00:19:07,500 --> 00:19:08,500
Go! Go!

217
00:19:10,958 --> 00:19:12,833
Retreat! Everyone, get back!

218
00:19:14,875 --> 00:19:17,000
Run for your lives!
Go! Go! Go! Go! Go!

219
00:19:17,125 --> 00:19:18,875
Go! Go! Go!

220
00:19:19,833 --> 00:19:21,250
Go! Go! Go! I've got you!

221
00:19:21,333 --> 00:19:22,708
After them!

222
00:19:27,291 --> 00:19:29,000
After them!

223
00:19:32,250 --> 00:19:33,833
Leia, we got to hurry.

224
00:19:33,916 --> 00:19:36,625
Are you listening to me?
I feel like you're not listening to me.

225
00:19:36,708 --> 00:19:38,375
Would you stop talking?

226
00:19:39,000 --> 00:19:41,625
He said it was a red breaker. Red.

227
00:19:42,333 --> 00:19:43,916
I know what he said.

228
00:19:44,000 --> 00:19:46,000
Go! Go! Go! Retreat!
Go! Move!

229
00:19:46,083 --> 00:19:48,750
- Go! Go! Go!
Come on!

230
00:19:48,833 --> 00:19:49,833
Move!

231
00:19:49,916 --> 00:19:52,000
- I've got you. Come on.

232
00:20:02,125 --> 00:20:04,375
No mercy! Seal them in!

233
00:20:05,000 --> 00:20:06,708
- Block the tunnel!
- No!

234
00:20:11,291 --> 00:20:13,000
Quick!

235
00:20:26,833 --> 00:20:29,666
- Tala!

236
00:20:29,750 --> 00:20:31,625
- No!
Wipe them out!

237
00:20:38,500 --> 00:20:39,541
Tala!

238
00:20:41,250 --> 00:20:42,291
Tala!

239
00:20:42,375 --> 00:20:44,208
No! Tala!

240
00:20:56,208 --> 00:20:57,333
Tala!

241
00:21:15,875 --> 00:21:16,875
Tala!

242
00:21:21,958 --> 00:21:23,041
Go!

243
00:21:23,125 --> 00:21:25,208
No!

244
00:21:27,041 --> 00:21:28,541
May the Force be with you.

245
00:21:32,708 --> 00:21:34,083
Get back!

246
00:21:56,041 --> 00:21:58,791
Please tell me we're close.

247
00:21:58,875 --> 00:22:00,208
Leia, you close?

248
00:22:00,958 --> 00:22:02,250
Working on it.

249
00:22:03,958 --> 00:22:05,041
She's working on it.

250
00:22:09,958 --> 00:22:12,333
The Grand Inquisitor
has breached the walls.

251
00:22:12,416 --> 00:22:13,791
We shall have him soon.

252
00:22:14,458 --> 00:22:17,208
Tell her to stand down.

253
00:22:17,291 --> 00:22:18,291
My Lord?

254
00:22:19,083 --> 00:22:21,833
Kenobi is already ours.

255
00:22:30,375 --> 00:22:31,958
There's no way out, Master.

256
00:22:37,250 --> 00:22:38,541
Admit you are beaten.

257
00:22:40,541 --> 00:22:41,708
What is it?

258
00:22:41,791 --> 00:22:42,916
What's wrong?

259
00:22:43,166 --> 00:22:44,333
It's over.

260
00:22:48,250 --> 00:22:49,291
I'm going back.

261
00:22:49,875 --> 00:22:51,000
You can't quit.

262
00:22:51,791 --> 00:22:54,416
I fought for too long.
You can't just throw that away.

263
00:22:55,291 --> 00:22:57,500
It won't make a difference.
They want all of us.

264
00:22:57,583 --> 00:23:00,708
- Vader wants me.
- If you surrender, she died for nothing.

265
00:23:01,416 --> 00:23:04,166
- He'll keep coming.
- That's why I have to stop him.

266
00:23:04,958 --> 00:23:06,083
You're going to fight him?

267
00:23:07,500 --> 00:23:09,000
He expects me to surrender.

268
00:23:09,083 --> 00:23:11,916
He knows I'll do everything I can
to protect these people.

269
00:23:13,625 --> 00:23:14,708
You'll be on your own.

270
00:23:16,083 --> 00:23:17,250
No.

271
00:23:20,500 --> 00:23:23,250
Haja, look out for her, will you?

272
00:23:24,458 --> 00:23:27,333
You want to tell me
how you're gonna fight without a weapon?

273
00:23:28,583 --> 00:23:30,041
There are other ways to fight.

274
00:23:38,375 --> 00:23:39,375
Seize him.

275
00:23:46,041 --> 00:23:47,541
Come on, where is it?

276
00:24:15,666 --> 00:24:17,666
Inform Lord Vader,

277
00:24:18,083 --> 00:24:21,583
Kenobi is ours.

278
00:24:28,125 --> 00:24:29,125
He's on his way.

279
00:24:30,708 --> 00:24:32,041
You're gonna die soon.

280
00:24:34,041 --> 00:24:35,791
You're not bringing him to me.

281
00:24:37,000 --> 00:24:39,375
I'm bringing him to you.

282
00:24:43,208 --> 00:24:44,666
This isn't over yet.

283
00:24:52,583 --> 00:24:54,250
There are families back there.

284
00:24:54,916 --> 00:24:55,916
Children.

285
00:24:57,625 --> 00:24:59,375
Are you gonna let him do it again,

286
00:25:00,458 --> 00:25:01,750
what he did to you?

287
00:25:06,708 --> 00:25:09,625
We could end this together.

288
00:25:18,291 --> 00:25:19,833
What makes you think

289
00:25:21,000 --> 00:25:22,541
he won't see it coming?

290
00:25:24,083 --> 00:25:26,458
Because all he'll see is me.

291
00:26:19,166 --> 00:26:20,208
There.

292
00:26:20,666 --> 00:26:21,916
Your weapon's gone.

293
00:26:23,833 --> 00:26:24,875
It's over.

294
00:26:25,666 --> 00:26:29,000
Your need for victory, Anakin,
it blinds you.

295
00:26:45,125 --> 00:26:46,750
Where is he?

296
00:26:46,833 --> 00:26:48,916
I have him secured inside, my Lord.

297
00:26:49,000 --> 00:26:51,208
I will bring him in myself.

298
00:27:02,041 --> 00:27:03,541
Come on. Come on.

299
00:27:06,083 --> 00:27:07,083
There it is.

300
00:27:09,166 --> 00:27:12,083
- Lola? What are you doing in here?

301
00:27:12,458 --> 00:27:14,250
Lola, stop! Stop!

302
00:27:17,125 --> 00:27:18,583
A restraining bolt?

303
00:27:22,375 --> 00:27:23,583
- Got it.

304
00:27:23,958 --> 00:27:25,083
Much better.

305
00:27:43,083 --> 00:27:44,083
Got it.

306
00:27:57,458 --> 00:27:58,458
Okay.

307
00:28:02,125 --> 00:28:04,541
All right, everybody, run!
Come on, let's go.

308
00:28:10,750 --> 00:28:11,958
Everything's all set.

309
00:28:12,916 --> 00:28:13,916
Leia!

310
00:28:16,666 --> 00:28:17,666
Well done!

311
00:28:18,958 --> 00:28:19,958
Where's Tala?

312
00:28:23,208 --> 00:28:24,875
Help who you can.
Let's go!

313
00:28:24,958 --> 00:28:27,000
Let's get to the transport, people!

314
00:28:27,083 --> 00:28:28,583
Move! Move! Let's go!

315
00:28:29,958 --> 00:28:31,958
Come on. We need to get to the transport.

316
00:29:34,625 --> 00:29:36,291
You're a great warrior, Anakin,

317
00:29:37,083 --> 00:29:39,458
but your need to prove yourself
is your undoing.

318
00:29:44,375 --> 00:29:45,833
Until you overcome it,

319
00:29:48,208 --> 00:29:49,833
a Padawan you will still be.

320
00:30:25,666 --> 00:30:29,750
He was wise to use you against me.

321
00:32:35,166 --> 00:32:40,000
Did you really believe
I did not see it, youngling?

322
00:32:45,291 --> 00:32:48,625
You are of no further use.

323
00:32:55,208 --> 00:32:57,125
Hello, Third Sister.

324
00:32:59,875 --> 00:33:04,833
Revenge does wonders for the will
to live, don't you think?

325
00:33:08,125 --> 00:33:10,041
Your rage

326
00:33:11,833 --> 00:33:12,958
was useful.

327
00:33:14,791 --> 00:33:17,250
Now it is tiresome.

328
00:33:21,416 --> 00:33:23,958
We will leave you where we found you.

329
00:33:25,208 --> 00:33:28,166
In the gutter, where you belong.

330
00:33:37,166 --> 00:33:38,208
Goodbye...

331
00:33:39,416 --> 00:33:40,750
Grand Inquisitor.

332
00:34:13,875 --> 00:34:15,375
Our hyperdrive is down,

333
00:34:17,416 --> 00:34:18,833
and they're behind us.

334
00:34:51,750 --> 00:34:52,750
Kenobi,

335
00:34:53,416 --> 00:34:54,583
are you listening to me?

336
00:34:55,833 --> 00:34:57,083
Something's wrong.

337
00:35:11,750 --> 00:35:14,416
If he's found you,
if he's learned of the children...

338
00:35:15,458 --> 00:35:16,750
I'll head to Tatooine.

339
00:35:18,958 --> 00:35:19,958
Owen wi--

340
00:35:20,416 --> 00:35:21,500
Help the boy.

341
00:35:25,666 --> 00:35:26,666
What is it?

342
00:35:32,958 --> 00:35:33,958
Are you okay?

343
00:35:37,250 --> 00:35:38,333
I'm sure it's nothing.

344
00:35:39,416 --> 00:35:40,500
Thank you, Roken.
